  "historyNote": "#9053, eff 1-2-08; ss by #11008, eff 12-31-15 (from Ins 801.13); ss by #14505, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36 (formerly Ins 801.14)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
